# The last page reached by pagination: no hydra:PagedCollection/nextPage
# triple at all, so the loop's `g.value(subject=URIRef(next_page),
# predicate=hydra:nextPage)` on THIS page's throwaway graph comes back None
# and the while loop stops after one hop. A second dcat:Dataset subject, so
# the region's final loop sees two solutions once page1 and page2 are both
# merged into `graph`. ex:noise is neighbouring content of an unrelated type,
# to prove the dcat:Dataset match does not pick it up.
@prefix dcat: <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .

ex:ds2 a dcat:Dataset ;
    dcat:title "Second page dataset" .

ex:noise a ex:NotADataset .
